|---|---:|---|---:|---:|---|---:|
| s0/N | −0.434917574370 | negative | 11 | 0 | zero | 0 |
| s0/S | +1.600683260550 | positive | 2 | 0 | zero | 0 |
| s0/R | −3.357195956583 | negative | 18 | 0 | zero | 0 |
