    13	# PART A — 忠實重建（`thesis.pdf` Ch4）
    14	
    15	## 7.1 三個階段（p33）
    16	
    17	論文自己的分法：
    18	
    19	| 階段 | 名稱 | 做什麼 |
    20	|---|---|---|
    21	| **§4.1** | **Catfish-effect-based data preparation** | **外部求解器**預先產生高 EE 樣本 ⟹ **播種 catfish replay memory** |
    22	| **§4.2** | **Catfish-effect-based DRL training** | 雙 agent + 三機制 + 兩種訓練模式（一般 / 週期介入） |
    23	| **§4.3** | **Catfish-effect-based DRL optimization of EE** | 訓練完的 CDRL 推論 |
    24	
    25	論文自述的**三個核心機制**（p13 逐字）：
    26	> *"all experiences are separated based on an **energy efficiency (EE) threshold**, the two DRL agents are
    27	> assigned **different discount factors** to focus on distinct objectives, and the catfish agent is provided
    28	> [with an adaptive competitive reward]"*
    29	
    30	---
    31	
    32	## 7.2 §4.1 — **Phase-1：資料預生成**（⭐ 這是被忽略最久的組件）
    33	
    34	`thesis.pdf` p35（逐字，三步）：
    35	
    36	1. **枚舉**：用 **DFT codebook** 產生候選
    37	   $$ \tilde{\Phi}_{RIS} = \{\tilde{\phi}_1, \dots, \tilde{\phi}_m, \dots, \tilde{\phi}_{2N}\}
    38	   \qquad\text{（RIS 相位）} $$
    39	   $$ \tilde{F}^{RF} = \{\tilde{F}^{RF}_1, \dots, \tilde{F}^{RF}_m, \dots\}
    40	   \qquad\text{（類比 beamforming）} $$
    41	2. **求解**：對每個候選，用 **WMMSE**（weighted minimum mean square error，論文引 [22]）算出數位 beamformer。
    42	3. **選擇**：**取 EE 最大的那個候選**。
    43	
    44	$$ \boxed{\;\big(\phi^\star,\, F^{RF\star},\, w^{BB\star}\big)
    45	\;=\; \arg\max_{\;\tilde\phi \in \tilde\Phi_{RIS},\;\; \tilde F \in \tilde F^{RF}}
    46	\;\; \mathrm{EE}\Big(\tilde\phi,\; \tilde F,\; w^{BB}_{\mathrm{WMMSE}}(\tilde\phi, \tilde F)\Big)\;} $$
    47	
    48	**產出的 "exemplary solution cases" 被**（逐字）：
    49	
    50	> *"stored into the **catfish replay memory** … serving as **the INITIAL experience replay data for CDRL**."*
    51	
    52	> ### ⟹ **catfish【有】外部專家，而且它是一個【求解器】（不是「另一個爛 agent」）。**
    53	> ### ⟹ **這是一個【枚舉 → 求解 → 取最大】的【搜尋】，不是一步貪婪規則。**
    54	
    55	---
    56	
    57	## 7.3 §4.2 — 訓練（雙 agent + 三機制）
    58	
    59	### 7.3.0 骨幹：actor-critic（見 `06`）
    60	
    61	| | 公式 |
    62	|---|---|
    63	| State (4.1) | `s_t = [P_Tot, Q, h_k, g_k, a_t]` |
    64	| Action (4.2) | `a_t = [w_k^BB, F^RF, C^RF, (Λ_RIS), ϕ_RIS, (A_RIS/B_RIS)]` — **連續** |
    65	| Reward (4.3) | $ r_t = \sum_{k=1}^{N_{UE}} R_k(\cdot) $ — **EE** |
    66	| TD (4.4) | $ \delta_t = r_t + \gamma Q_\Phi\big(s_{t+1}, \pi_\theta(s_{t+1})\big) - Q_\Phi(s_t, a_t) $ |
    67	| Critic loss (4.5) | $ L(\Phi) = (\delta_t)^2 $ |
    68	| Critic 更新 (4.6) | $ \Phi_{t+1} = \Phi_t - \mu_c \nabla_\Phi L(\Phi_t) $ |
    69	| **Actor 更新 (4.7)** | $ \theta_{t+1} = \theta_t - \mu_a \nabla_a Q_\Phi(s_t,a)\big\|_{a=\pi(s_t)} \nabla_\theta \pi_\theta(s_t) $ |
    70	
    71	### 7.3.1 **M1 — 經驗分層**（Experience Stratification，Fig 4.7，p42-43）
    72	
    73	**規則（逐字）**：
    74	> *"Experiences with **higher EE** are stored in the **catfish** replay memory, while those with **moderate EE**
    75	> are stored in the **main** replay memory."*
    76	> *"If `EE ≥ EE_high`, the dataset is stored in the catfish replay memory as **high-value data**."*
    77	
    78	$$ \boxed{\;
    79	\big(s,a,r,s'\big) \;\longrightarrow\;
    80	\begin{cases}
    81	\mathcal{D}^{CF} & \text{if } \mathrm{EE}(s,a) \;\ge\; \mathrm{EE}_{high} \\[4pt]
    82	\mathcal{D}^{M}  & \text{otherwise (moderate EE)}
    83	\end{cases}\;} $$
    84	
    85	**目的（逐字）**：把 catfish 定位成 *"the **ignition point for high-level experiences**"*，
    86	建立一個 **elite challenger** 角色 ⟹ **吸引 main agent 去觀察它的行為並調整策略**。
    87	
    88	### 7.3.2 **M2 — 非對稱折扣**（Asymmetric Discounting，Fig 4.8，p43-44）
    89	
    90	$$ \boxed{\;\gamma^{M} \;\le\; \gamma^{CF}\;} $$
    91	
    92	**理由（逐字）**：
    93	- 觀察 (4.4)：折扣因子讓 Q 值的權重以 `r_t + γ r_{t+1} + γ² r_{t+2} + γ³ r_{t+3} + …` 衰減。
    94	  **γ 越接近 1，衰減越慢，越重視未來。**
    95	- **main agent** 用**小 γ** ⟹ *"focuses on **short-term** demands to **accelerate convergence**"* ⟹ **近視**。
    96	- **catfish agent** 用**大 γ** ⟹ *"emphasizes **long-term** objectives"* ⟹ **遠視、學到更 farsighted 的策略**。
    97	- 引 Hou et al. [23]：*"when an RL agent approaches the final outcome, a **larger discount factor is beneficial**."*
    98	- **與 M1 的關係**：*"based on the prior experience stratification, **superior experiences are assigned a larger
    99	  discount factor** for the catfish agent's tasks, while ordinary experiences receive a smaller discount factor."*
   100	
   101	### 7.3.3 **ACRM — 自適應競爭獎勵**（Fig 4.9，p44-45）⭐ Eq 4.8 / 4.9
   102	
   103	$$ \boxed{\;r^{C} \;=\; r \;+\; \eta\, r^{S}\;} \tag{4.8} $$
   104	
   105	$$ \boxed{\;r^{S}_t \;=\; r^{CF}_t \;-\; r^{M}_t\;} \tag{4.9} $$
   106	
   107	| 符號 | 意義（逐字） |
   108	|---|---|
   109	| `r` | *"the **original EE reward** from the environment"* |
   110	| `r^S` | *"the additional **shaped** reward"* |
   111	| `η` | *"the **coefficient** controlling the weight of this reward. When **η → 0**, the model **degrades to the original reward model**."* |
   112	| `r^M_t` | main agent 在**同一個任務**上達到的 EE |
   113	| `r^CF_t` | catfish agent 在**同一個任務**上達到的 EE |
   114	
   115	**語意（逐字）**：
   116	> *"The **greater the lead** of the catfish agent over the main agent on the same task, **the larger the
   117	> additional reward** received by the catfish agent. Conversely, the catfish agent is **penalized more when
   118	> trailing behind**, reinforcing the **competitive dynamics**."*
   119	
   120	**論文自己的引用**：*"The ACRM is **similar to the Self-Adaptive Success Rate Sampling (SASR)** proposed by
   121	Shen et al. [24]."* ⟹ **ACRM 在論文裡也不是原創。要引 [24]。**
   122	
   123	**(4.10)–(4.13)**：把 (4.4)–(4.7) 套到 catfish agent 上，用 `r^C` 和 `γ^CF`：
   124	
   125	$$ \delta^{CF}_t \;=\; r^{C}_t \;+\; \gamma^{CF} Q_{\Phi^{CF}}\big(s_{t+1}, \pi_{\theta^{CF}}(s_{t+1})\big)
   126	\;-\; Q_{\Phi^{CF}}(s_t, a_t) \tag{4.10} $$
   127	
   128	（4.11–4.13 = 對應的 critic loss / critic 更新 / actor 更新。）
   129	
   130	### 7.3.4 **M3 — 隨機週期性介入**（Fig 4.5 / 4.6，p41-42）
   131	
   132	**兩種訓練模式**：
   133	
   134	**(a) 一般訓練模式**（Fig 4.5，逐字）：
   135	> *"the main agent and catfish agent each have **independent** experience replay memories, discount factors,
   136	> and reward mechanisms, **training independently**."*
   137	
   138	**(b) 介入訓練模式**（Fig 4.6，逐字）：
   139	> *"a portion of the **high EE experiences collected by the catfish agent** is sampled and **mixed into the
   140	> main agent's training batches**."*
   141	
   142	$$ \boxed{\;S^{mix} \;=\; S^{M} \cup S^{CF},
   143	\qquad \underbrace{70\%}_{\text{from } \mathcal{D}^{M}} \;+\; \underbrace{30\%}_{\text{from } \mathcal{D}^{CF}}\;} $$
   144	
   145	（逐字：*"In the mixed batch `S_mix = S^M ∪ S^CF`, **70% of the samples are drawn from the main replay memory
   146	`S^M`**, and **30% from the catfish replay memory `S^CF`**, where `S^M ∈ D^M`, `S^CF ∈ D^CF`."*）
   147	
   148	**觸發**：**隨機間隔**（"randomized periodic intervention"）。
   149	
   150	> ### ⟹ **這就是「conduit」：catfish 蒐集的高 EE 經驗，週期性地灌進 main 的訓練。**
   151	> ### ⟹ **注意：更新的是【main agent】。catfish 只是「經驗的來源 + 過濾器」。**
