    13	## Root question and decision-tree node
    14	
    15	The root collapse question (ENV- / STATE-INPUT- / ALGORITHM-rooted) is untouched
    16	by this ADR. This is the narrower node ADR-008 deferred: after the mechanism
    17	fixture passes, can the moving footprint be carried into a **formal** contract
    18	with a fixed non-retrospective service area, an explicit constellation/attitude,
    19	and a genuine multi-satellite handover choice?
    20	
    21	## Required properties of a formal contract
    22	
    23	A formal moving-footprint contract had to satisfy all eight of the following:
    24	
    25	1. 100 UE;
    26	2. a fixed, non-retrospectively selected service area;
    27	3. an explicit orbit / attitude / ECI-ECEF specification;
    28	4. multi-satellite handover opportunity;
